== Trivia ==
* The name of this challenge is a reference to the Magic: the Gathering term "cantrip", meaning a card that draws another card.
* The item cards in this challenge resemble the treasure cards from The Binding of Isaac: Four Souls.
* Specific item cards can be spawned during this challenge with the debug console command <code>spawn 5.300.N</code> where <code>N</code> is the collectible's ID+32768. For instance, to spawn a {{i|Mega Blast}} card, the number would be <code>5.300.33209</code>.
** Trying to spawn cantripped cards and picking them up during a normal run crashes the game.

